// Title: Potential appverifUI.DLL Sideloading
// Rule ID: ee6cea48-c5b6-4304-a332-10fc6446f484
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.persistence, attack.defense-evasion, attack.privilege-escalation, attack.t1574.001
// Category: image_load
// Product: windows
